    " *\n",
    " * Counts calls, not time. A pair of clock reads bracketing a function body cannot contain it:\n",
    " *   - a pair of rdtsc reads per call costs more than the small operation being timed;\n",
    " *   - reading once per N calls and subtracting windows measures inclusive time -- several components report the same loop;\n",
    " *   - closing on function exit with the cleanup attribute gets scheduled near the declaration by the compiler;\n",
